.nh
.TH "GUMROAD" "1" "Sep 2026" "Gumroad" "Gumroad CLI"

.SH NAME
gumroad-admin-purchases-refund - Refund a purchase as an admin


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgumroad admin purchases refund  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Refund a specific purchase end-to-end without going through the admin web UI.

.PP
The buyer email is required as a sanity check against the purchase. Without --amount,
the entire purchase is refunded. --force bypasses the refund-policy timeframe and
fine-print guards (the active-chargeback guard still applies). --cancel-subscription
cancels the linked subscription after a successful refund.

.PP
A reason is required. It is stored on the refund and shown to the creator in the
"A sale has been refunded" email so they know why Gumroad refunded the sale on
their behalf.


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--amount\fP=""
	Partial refund amount in displayed currency (e.g. 5, 5.00); omit for full refund

.PP
\fB--cancel-subscription\fP[=false]
	Cancel the linked subscription after the refund succeeds

.PP
\fB--email\fP=""
	Buyer email (required)

.PP
\fB--force\fP[=false]
	Bypass refund-policy timeframe and fine-print guards

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for refund

.PP
\fB--reason\fP=""
	Why the sale is being refunded; shown to the creator in the refund notification email (required)


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	Enable debug logging to stderr

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	Preview mutating requests without executing them

.PP
\fB--jq\fP=""
	Filter JSON output with a jq expression

.PP
\fB--json\fP[=false]
	Output as JSON

.PP
\fB--no-color\fP[=false]
	Disable color output

.PP
\fB--no-image\fP[=false]
	Disable image rendering

.PP
\fB--no-input\fP[=false]
	Disable interactive prompts

.PP
\fB--non-interactive\fP[=false]
	Run in explicit CI/agent mode

.PP
\fB--page-delay\fP=0s
	Wait between paginated --all requests (e.g. 200ms, 1s)

.PP
\fB--plain\fP[=false]
	Output as plain tab-separated text

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	Suppress non-essential output

.PP
\fB--yes\fP[=false]
	Skip confirmation prompts


.SH EXAMPLE
.EX
  gumroad admin purchases refund 12345 --email buyer@example.com --reason "Buyer reported being charged twice"
  gumroad admin purchases refund 12345 --email buyer@example.com --amount 5.00 --reason "Partial refund agreed with buyer"
  gumroad admin purchases refund 12345 --email buyer@example.com --force --reason "Product not delivered"
  gumroad admin purchases refund 12345 --email buyer@example.com --cancel-subscription --reason "Buyer requested cancellation and refund"
.EE


.SH SEE ALSO
\fBgumroad-admin-purchases(1)\fP
